MAXID:10

51:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: You can't do anything now.
52:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: He's no threat without his axes.
53:[$000066]Guest[$ffffff]: <struggles to speak> Same as with Valtaria. You still needed a powerful artifact to defeat me.
54:[$000066]Guest[$ffffff]: That only reinforces my belief that without armor, you're nothing.
55:Malcolm: Hey :5_00145 We defeated you fair and square...
56:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: You killed my son... My best friend! You reduced my entire city to dust!! You don't deserve to live in this world!
57:[$09F641]Attilia[$ffffff]: Dyron, stop! You gave my brother a choice, give him one too.
58:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: ...
59:[$09F641]Attilia[$ffffff]: Reveal yourself. Take off that helmet!
60:[$000066]Guest[$ffffff]: You know me.
61:[$000066]Guest[$ffffff]: An old friend
62:[$000066]Guest[$ffffff]: An ally
63:[$000066]Guest[$ffffff]: And even a ruler. 
64:[$000066]Guest[$ffffff]: I am...
65:[$000066]Guest[$ffffff]: King Ratling.
66:[$FAE16B]Alan[$ffffff]: Ratling:5_00144
67:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: No, no. That's impossible. It can't be you!
68:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: So an attack on the garrison... It was all a setup!
69:Malcolm: But why, you were the ruler of Valtaria itself.
70:[$000066]Ratling[$ffffff]: I was the lord of a village, ordinary peasants no one cared about, and you led me to power, all the way to the capital of Artidram. Power is a disease. With each passing day, I craved more. I seized the opportunity when you left for King Teryton.
71:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: You killed so many!
72:[$000066]Ratling[$ffffff]: Your son wanted to stop me at all costs. So did Tamaio.
73:[$000066]Ratling[$ffffff]: I see it now. Only the great in mind should wield such power.
74:[$000066]Ratling[$ffffff]: I apologize. Forgive me.
75:[$09F641]Attilia[$ffffff]: For killing so many people, Artidram. Destroying Valtaria, Hanrain, Andaro, and many other cities, you will not be forgiven today. 
76:[$000066]Ratling[$ffffff]: Very well, your highness, I am ready for judgment.
77:[$09F641]Attilia[$ffffff]: May grace be upon you in the afterlife.